   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Legal Assistance IOM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal assistance IOM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM kommer att koordinera denna insats som inbegriper m&#xe5;nga akt&#xf6;rer. Syftet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka antal fall som tas upp i r&#xe4;tteg&#xe5;ng f&#xf6;r  m&#xe4;nniskohandel. Utbildning av fr&#xe4;mst advokater och r&#xe4;ttsombud till st&#xf6;rsta del i Turkiet, men ocks&#xe5; i l&#xe4;nderna runt Svarta havet som oftast &#xe4;r &quot;ursprungsl&#xe4;nderna&quot; f&#xf6;r offren.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will coordinate this project which includes many actors. The main purpose is to have an increased number of trafficking cases taken up in court. The project will consist of training to lawyers, and judicial staff mainly in Turkey but also in the countries in the Black Sea Region, where most of the victims originate from.</narrative>
  </description>
